# 统一换行为 LF：本机 core.autocrlf=true，若不锁定会在每次 checkout 产生
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 伪改动提示，污染 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源，禁止任何换行符转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary

# 签名材料（本就不入库，此处双保险）
*.p12  binary
*.cer  binary
*.p7b  binary
